    "detailed_description": "<h1>Continued draw iit!</h1><p></p><br><h1>New puzzle!Try again!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/816190/extras/9db008248afdeff121d36f4a7c95f531.poster.avif?t=1586093286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/816190/extras/9db008248afdeff121d36f4a7c95f531.webm?t=1586093286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/816190/extras/9fe26e17aa31647ef1633edcce6075e4.avif?t=1586093286\" /></div><br><br>Draw it! With the help of drawing and physics - help the smiley to get to the platform.<br>Draw a smiley path using geometric shapes to get to the platform!<br>Use your imagination to achieve the goal!<br>You have a huge number of options!<br>Draw and reach the goal!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/816190/extras/e98511a1321149b958089f1b36e4d2e8.webp?t=1586093286\" /></div><br><br>\u2712 70 levels!<br>\u2712 many achievements!<br>\u2712 low system requirements!<br>\u2712 creativity!<br>\u2712 Drawing!<br>\u2712 Intuitive gameplay!<br>\u2712 Realistic 2d physics!<br>\u2712 funny music!<br>\u2712 very low price!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/816190/extras/1d21cfa796e5006b3055649274b5edb4.poster.avif?t=1586093286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/816190/extras/1d21cfa796e5006b3055649274b5edb4.webm?t=1586093286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/816190/extras/1d21cfa796e5006b3055649274b5edb4.mp4?t=1586093286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
